Hello,

I've seen many posts asking how to get really high scores. I've acheived
around 7.5million, but this was simply because I wasn't sure what I was doing
and so went up and down the dungeon umpteen times. Does this mean I'm a better
player than others? I think not.

In my mind, achieving a low completion score is much much harder. Anyone can
sit for ages massing hitpoints etc, but to take on the endgame and complete
with a relatively inexperienced character must surely be a harder feat.

So, what's the lowest score people have ascended with. For arguments sake here,
I'll say that you should have ascended to demigod and hence received that
hefty doubling (or there abouts) of score.

